{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方的大号标题首先进入视线，尤其是紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”和“都不自在了呢”。随后下方灰白色大句和橙色大句也非常显眼。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起；但眼下对方仍在身边，两人依然亲近。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"有点不安、没底，同时有一点高兴；觉得对方可能喜欢自己陪在身边。\",\n  \"missed\": \"中间三行小字里的情绪变化、紧绷感、注意力变化，以及对接下来怎么办的疑问。标题中的未来担忧与眼下真实处境之间的反差也不容易一次完整捕捉。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：顶部标题、灰白色大句、橙色大句。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：要结合灰白色句子的眼下处境和橙色句子的高兴，才能理解此刻的状态及感受。\",\n    \"小字连续堆叠，要在多条细节之间挑选重点。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1aee7588-5bf7-479c-89cc-68fea01e5864", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021410175386Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:14:58.844634+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9853705c7deb474d7ca851ae0a4f46dab2a895e10e3c24588f89a5538e7a8cee", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9